    "font" : "CMR10",
    "font size" : 10.909,
    "text color" : "[0.0]",
    "content" : "with increasing tail starting at i0. Also observe that Theorem 5.3 and the fact that supp(cw) = [i0 −1] imply that Ck,n,w has exactly"
